WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.960
<b>SPORTS DAY</b>

00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.460
Athletes' oath!

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:07.960
The athletes of this school solemnly promise
to obey the rules of good sportsmanship…

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:12.380
…to play each game fairly and honorably,
and to compete to the best of our abilities!

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:24.170
Senpai. You don't look very excited.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.670
You already know why. My athletic reflexes…

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.080
Are pretty bad, yeah. I know.

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.880
But as I told you before,
there's nothing you can do about that.

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:40.500
We will now begin our first event: the 100 meter dash.

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.790
Will all participating students please
assemble at the starting line.

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:46.710
I'll talk to you later.

00:00:48.130 --> 00:00:49.250
H-hey!

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:52.670
Good luck!

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:56.630
Thanks!

00:00:58.330 --> 00:00:59.880
Urushi!

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.750
Maki.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:03.830
Is that Tanaka-kun? He's pretty cute.

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:05.420
Y-you think so?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.000
Are the two of you as close as I think you are?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.670
What?

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:12.380
H-he's just a member of my club.

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.330
Reeeally…

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:20.580
Saa fumidasou ippo mae e

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:24.000
Kimi no kodou kanjisasete

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:27.250
Kakehiki wa Pokerface

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:32.330
Kizukaretaku wa nai kara

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:35.790
Kyori ni shite suu senchi

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:38.920
Mawarimichi shite

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:42.460
Egao neratteru

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:45.880
Hisoka na estratégia

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:49.040
Suki ga nai defense

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:52.250
Mou sukoshi dake

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:58.670
Ayumiyoru kara mukou o miteite

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:02.670
Kizutsuku no kowaku naru

00:02:02.670 --> 00:02:05.880
Sonna yoru mo aru

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:09.380
Surechigai kara no chance

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:13.670
Nogasanai yo dai-gyakuten

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.380
Saa fumidasou ippo mae e

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:22.540
Monogatari wa jibun de

00:02:23.170 --> 00:02:29.170
Kakidashi wa itsumo "honto wa" "zutto" kara

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.710
Takurami nara shinkoukei

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:36.040
Kimi no kodou kanjisasete

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:39.500
Kakehiki wa Pokerface

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:44.750
Kizukaretaku wa nai kara

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:51.250
<b>Game 2: I Want to Make You Happy, Senpai</b>

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.130
Oooh, he got first place!

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:54.710
Tanaka-kun was really fast!

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.880
Uh, yeah.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:58.710
That first-year's name is Tanaka-kun?

00:02:58.920 --> 00:02:59.960
That's right!

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.000
He's a really good athlete.

00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:05.080
The white team might actually stand
a chance of winning this year!

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.380
Take that and that and that!

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.040
Gimme more!

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:13.880
Hiya!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.330
Ow!

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.500
Let's do this!

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.330
Wow, you're doing great, Urushi!

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.540
Man, you're our hero, Tanaka-kun!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.750
Thanks to you, the white team is winning!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.210
Oh, it's nothing.

00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:22.250
By the way, Tanaka-kun, are you in a club?

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:23.580
Got any interest in the track team?

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:26.080
Sorry, I'm gonna have to ask you to forget that thought.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.460
You won't be recruiting my shogi club member.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:32.790
Senpai?

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.670
What? Shogi club?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.920
Wait, does our school have a shogi club?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.420
I don't think so.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.500
Nope. I never heard of any shogi club.

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:48.880
But never mind that, Tanaka-kun.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:52.210
If you joined our team, I bet
we could even make it to nationals!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.000
If you don't mind, would you
at least think about it? Please?

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:01.630
Well, I guess it makes sense that no one knows about us.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.580
Of course they don't.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.130
Senpai.

00:05:08.210 --> 00:05:10.380
I'm going to score even more points.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:11.040
Huh?

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:15.420
I think that way, we'll be able to tell
everyone that there is a shogi club.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:17.630
O-oh yeah.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:20.670
And then we might get more people to join!

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:21.500
What?

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:29.630
So you still want to add more members
and make it an official club?

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.710
Well, of course!

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.790
And that… would make you happy?

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:35.580
Yes!

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.130
The wish of the one…

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:41.920
The one? The one what?

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:43.000
Okay, I'll do it.

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.210
From here on out, I'll fight for the shogi club.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:48.880
I'll do everything I can for you, Senpai.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.880
What a good underclassman friend you have.

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.170
Maki?

00:05:55.630 --> 00:05:59.710
Tanaka-kun, I'm supposed to run in
the three-legged race with Urushi next.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:02.210
But I'm not feeling well, so will you take my place?

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.880
I'd love to!

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:07.420
Good luck, Urushi!

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.540
I think she's getting the wrong idea about us.

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.250
How do you mean?

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:14.920
Never mind.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:21.330
Next is the three-legged race. Will all participating
students please assemble at the starting line.

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:29.170
Are you sure our different heights
aren't going to make this too hard?

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:30.880
Of course they won't.

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.420
You think so?

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:34.210
Yo, Ayumu!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:38.920
Hate to break it to you, but we're gonna
go ahead and win this one.

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:43.130
Who's that?

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:44.830
Takeru and Sakurako.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.960
They're both long-time friends of mine.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:52.420
And they're really fast together in the three-legged race.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.380
But he's so much taller than her.

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:57.170
Exactly. That's how I know we'll be fine, too.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.170
Oh, they're coming with the baton.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.500
One-two, one-two.

00:07:02.130 --> 00:07:03.710
I-I'm going to put my arm around you.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:09.130
Me, too. If I may be so bold.

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:16.080
Oh, what's this? Is he embarrassed?

00:07:17.330 --> 00:07:19.290
Maybe it's time to tease him a little bit.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.630
So I guess this is our first joint venture, huh?

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:26.790
What was that? I didn't quite hear you.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.460
Forget it! Just look!

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.380
One-two, one-two.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.040
The baton is coming!

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:34.790
Okay, we'll go on three!

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:35.790
One, two…

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.420
Which foot first?

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.420
I-I'm sorry, Senpai.

00:07:42.130 --> 00:07:43.460
For crying out loud.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.830
Alright, we'll start with the inside foot.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.130
Here goes. One, two…

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:55.130
Senpai…

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:56.500
S-sorry.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.000
Oh man, everybody is passing them!

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:02.130
So not even Tanaka-kun can make up
for Yaotome-san's clumsiness?

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:05.000
Oh, what does it matter?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.830
You can do it, Urushi!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.580
Uh…I thought you weren't feeling well?

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.000
That was pretty terrible.

00:08:16.500 --> 00:08:19.580
I'm sorry. If I hadn't made that mistake at the beginning…

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:25.500
Aww, don't let it bother you!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:30.170
I'm always playing against you at shogi,
and I finally got to work with you now.

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.330
It was, you know, pretty fun, I guess.

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:37.460
I mean, that may not mean much coming from
the one who dragged us both down, but…

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.580
It's a good point. I had fun, too.

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:48.380
It was our first joint venture, after all.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:51.170
You did hear me!

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:57.210
We will now begin the final event of the day:
the all-student relay.

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:12.080
And the red team is the first to pass the baton!

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.960
Yesss! Go, Sakurako!

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.750
Don't fall over, Urushi!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:27.040
Senpai!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:31.000
No matter how much ground you lose, I'll take it back!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.080
So everything is going to be okay!

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:45.330
Look at her go! The blue team flies ahead!

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:59.080
Alright, Tanaka-kun! Let's make good on your claim
and make sure everything really is okay!

00:09:59.080 --> 00:09:59.880
Okay!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.000
The white team is pulling ahead!

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:13.580
Nice going!

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.630
She's about to pass the baton to their anchor!

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.000
Tanaka-kun!

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:26.130
Talk about speed! The white team is off like a shot,
trying to take the lead from the red team!

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.210
Heh, not bad, Ayumu!

00:10:31.630 --> 00:10:33.460
That Tanaka-kun is really something.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:35.960
Y-you can do it!

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.710
I think we might do this.

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:39.330
If we get first place, we win the whole day!

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:44.420
Now we get to the real challenge of this race!

00:10:44.960 --> 00:10:50.790
To give the relay race a more exciting twist, this year,
the anchor must also win a quick scavenger hunt!

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:51.880
What in the heck!?

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:04.000
What do you bet it says "bring back your crush"?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:05.880
No, that's too cliché...

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:09.250
What if it does say that, and he comes to get you?

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:11.290
No, it's not going to happen.

00:11:12.130 --> 00:11:14.500
Oooh, he's running this way!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:16.960
Does this mean…?

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:17.750
No!

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:19.630
No, it doesn't! It can't!

00:11:19.630 --> 00:11:20.210
Senpai!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.380
Please come with me.

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:27.540
You see?

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.670
O-okay, fine.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.420
Take this.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:47.580
What is happening?

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:48.750
What is happening?

00:11:51.710 --> 00:11:53.540
What is happening!?

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.710
He crossed the finish line!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.710
The white team comes in first place!

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.080
Wow! That was awesome!

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:01.630
Followed by the blue and pink teams!

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:06.630
Now if the judge approves his find, we win!

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:08.580
Paper, please.

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:11.630
Here. I'm Tanaka from the shogi club,
here for the white team.

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:13.080
Let's see…

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.080
Bring back an adorable object.

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.540
An adorable…

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.040
Object?

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:20.920
Surely there is no denying that she is adorable.

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:22.170
Uh, right.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:26.250
And to help you identify her as an object,
I carried her here in my arms.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.330
That's why he carried me like that?

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:30.080
What is your verdict?

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.080
My verdict is…

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.750
It counts!

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:44.500
The results are officially in!

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:48.250
The winning team of this year's
sports day is the white team!

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.080
We did it, Senpai!

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:59.000
Hip hip hooray!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:03.580
Hip hip hooray!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:01.170
I count…

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.960
As an object.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.540
<b>Bring back</b>

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.540
<b>your crush</b>

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.210
Dammit!

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:21.960
<b>School Library</b>

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:33.420
<b>The Fable</b>

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.460
Um, Takeru-kun.

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:33.250
I need the next one. I wish you'd go get me volume four.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:34.960
Why me?

00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:37.540
I don't want to get up.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.710
That's no reason to make other people do it.

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:44.710
And how many times have I told you to look people
in the eye when you talk to them?

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.380
Umm…

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:51.500
Get it for me.

00:13:51.500 --> 00:13:52.250
Now.

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:56.880
Right away.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.210
Thank you!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.500
<b>The</b>

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.500
<b>Fable</b>

00:14:12.670 --> 00:14:13.630
I told you…

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:16.040
Don't use hypnosis on me!

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.290
I wish you wouldn't get mad at me.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:20.710
It's awfully noisy in here.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.210
Hey, Ayumu.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:23.330
Ayumu-kun.

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:25.880
Here to find more books about shogi?

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.130
No. I need something else today, Takeru.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:31.080
Would you join the shogi club?

00:14:32.630 --> 00:14:34.080
Why would I do that?

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.630
You were so happy about getting all
that alone time with your senpai.

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:42.420
Senpai wants to get more members and
make the shogi club an official club.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:46.130
I see. So it's the wish of the one you love.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:49.710
But I'm not really good at using my head.

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.750
Besides, if I joined a club…

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:55.290
I wouldn't be able to walk home with her!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.380
Ayumu-kun needs your help. Join the club.

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:02.580
What!? Why am I hearing this from you of all people!?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.960
Join the club.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.670
<b>Club Application</b>

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.670
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.670
<b>I humbly request to join the aforementioned club.</b>

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.670
<b>Class 1-2</b>

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.670
<b>Name: Takeru Kakuryu</b>

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:15.130
I know! You should join, too, Sakurako!
We can play shogi together!

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:17.960
My policy is not to join those kinds of groups.

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:21.130
That's rich, coming from the girl
who just forced someone to join one!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:25.250
Actually, you shouldn't go to
the shogi club either, Takeru-kun.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:26.250
What!?

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.790
I mean, you'd be a third wheel.

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.500
But you're the one who literally made me join!

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:37.330
I wasn't interested, but now that I've joined,
I'm going to club activities--that's what a real man does!

00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:39.170
Then…

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:40.830
Not more hypnosis.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:42.710
Don't even try. My will is strong.

00:15:42.710 --> 00:15:45.540
So strong that not even a master hypnotist
like you can get me!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:46.880
Then you…

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.580
You won't be able to walk home from school with me?

00:15:53.880 --> 00:15:54.750
Ayumu.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.460
Yes?

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.830
I know I just joined and all, but can I be a ghost member?

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:02.210
I know I'm the one who asked you to join,
but I would prefer it that way.

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:04.170
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:04.170
<b>I humbly request to join the aforementioned club.</b>

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.290
<b>Class 1-2</b>

00:16:02.420 --> 00:16:03.290
<b>Name: Takeru Kakuryu</b>

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:03.460
Okay then.

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:04.170
<b>Club Application</b>

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.330
Thank you.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:14.540
Shogi, eh?

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:21.330
That Ayumu. First he quits kendo after doing it forever,
and now he's telling me to join the shogi club?

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.080
Dude makes no sense.

00:16:24.420 --> 00:16:26.880
Anyway, did you see the look on his face?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.920
Mm-hm. I've never seen him like that.

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.790
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.790
<b>Urushi Yaotome</b>

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:32.790
<b>Ayumu Tanaka</b>

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:33.500
That was more than just relief over me
being a ghost club member.

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.750
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.750
<b>Urushi Yaotome</b>

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:34.750
<b>Ayumu Tanaka</b>

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:34.130
Mm-hm.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.500
<b>Shogi Club</b>

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.500
<b>Urushi Yaotome</b>

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:36.500
<b>Ayumu Tanaka</b>

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:38.880
He must be so happy to be able
to do something for his senpai.

00:16:39.460 --> 00:16:40.290
Senpai.

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:43.380
<b>Check Out / Return</b>

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:48.290
How'd you like that? I'm going on a massive offensive.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.040
He's really crushing on her.

00:16:48.670 --> 00:16:51.080
You're gonna have a hard time fighting this one.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.330
He really is.

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:56.080
I'm undefeated again today!

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:57.750
Senpai.

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:58.420
What?

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:02.420
Actually, I found someone to join the club.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.420
As a ghost member, though.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.920
Oohh! That means…

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:11.830
Yes. Just one more member,
and we can be officially recognized as a club.

00:17:16.080 --> 00:17:17.630
Thank you so much, Tanaka!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:19.460
This makes me so happy!

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.170
I'm sorry.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.790
I lost consciousness for a second.

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.130
What!? Why? Are you okay!?

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:39.420
I didn't realize that it would make me
so happy to see you happy.

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.420
Is there anything else I can do to make you happy?

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.790
If it will please you, Senpai,
I would be willing to make any sacrifice.

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.250
Go on. Can you think of anything?

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.830
No--no sacrifices! That's scary!

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:57.830
Did you think of something?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.380
I'd like… to celebrate.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.830
A new place opened up near the park.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:08.460
They sell taiyaki--it's really good.

00:18:08.960 --> 00:18:10.960
I want to get some taiyaki and have a toast.

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:13.130
A-and then…

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:14.830
Tadah!

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:16.790
A portable shogi board!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:20.460
We can actually play shogi while eating taiyaki!

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:22.790
I like it. Let's go.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.380
Yes!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:28.580
And now, here's to our new club member!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.130
Cheers!

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:38.580
This taiyaki is so good!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.130
It is delicious.

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:42.460
Oh! You went with the potato filling!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:44.670
That stuff is so good.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:48.000
I had a hard time deciding between
that and the red bean filling.

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:49.710
Oh really?

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.710
If you want, you can have a bite.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:54.960
Are you sure?

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:55.710
Yes.

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:56.670
Yay!

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:58.330
Oh, but…

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.000
It's nothing.

00:19:04.960 --> 00:19:06.830
Is it me, or is your face red?

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:13.540
Don't tell me you're thinking about indirect kisses.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.880
I'm not really sure, but this is my chance!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:18.670
Now I can pay him back for all the times
he makes my face go red!

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:21.630
You and your dirty mind.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.540
Is it so wrong?

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:35.380
L-let's play shogi! A celebratory game!!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:43.290
So what is this new club member like?

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:45.210
He's been a friend of mine since we were kids.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.630
We were both running anchor
in the relay race at sports day.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.830
Ohh, the guy from the red team?

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:53.790
Yes. We played kendo together for ages.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.460
I guess you could have called him my rival.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:01.290
I get it. So that's why he's a ghost member.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.250
Since he's on the kendo team.

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:05.920
No, he's not in a team or club.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:10.210
Then is he busy as a class representative or something?

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:14.170
He's on the library committee,
but I think that's only two days a week.

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:15.790
Not exactly busy.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:17.790
Is it family trouble, then?

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.250
His family is pretty normal.

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:20.920
Does he work?

00:20:21.380 --> 00:20:23.040
Only Saturdays and Sundays.

00:20:23.380 --> 00:20:25.380
Does he h-hate shogi?

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:27.250
I don't think so.

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:29.540
Then why is he a ghost member?

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.210
He has his reasons.

00:20:32.130 --> 00:20:34.210
Well anyway, he is a ghost member.

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:37.790
Okay. But I guess that's how it is.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:43.830
Now we only need one more
member to be an official club.

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:48.960
We have to have more members?

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.580
I'd really rather it just be me and Senpai.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.170
How can I be so selfish?

00:20:58.460 --> 00:21:01.170
That's a pretty careless move
for all the time you took on it.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:01.880
What?

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:06.630
If you move there, then my pawn
is gonna capture your knight.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:08.460
Is something the matter?

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:13.880
Actually, I was in my head. I'm afraid I've been
putting too high a priority on my own feelings.

00:21:15.170 --> 00:21:20.080
Oohh, you mean you like the pawns
more than the knights?

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:25.250
Of course, because the kanji for your name
is the same as the one for pawn.

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:27.460
No, um… I wasn't talking about shogi...

00:21:27.460 --> 00:21:29.790
Seriously, I totally know how you feel.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.960
You would start prioritizing it. I have so been there.

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:36.880
<b>Ayumu</b>

00:21:34.250 --> 00:21:36.880
Because I like the ayumu, too!

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:46.830
I didn't mean it like that!
I got the words mixed up! So um…

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:48.630
I didn't mean it like that, okay!

00:21:52.960 --> 00:21:54.710
It's just too confusing!

00:22:04.210 --> 00:22:05.380
She's so cute.

00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:31.000
Tonari tte kotoba wa igai to han'yousei ga aru

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:38.000
Tatoeba 1 meter hanaretete mo tonari

00:22:38.330 --> 00:22:46.040
Kouchaku joutai akane ni somaru machi de

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:54.960
Honne ga shiritai hagurakashite kimi ga arukedo

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:04.540
Kizuite 50 senchi kennai (dou wah x2)

00:23:04.710 --> 00:23:12.250
Watashi wa 50 senchi kengai? (dou wah x2)

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:19.710
Futari de kaeru sono riyuu wa (dou wah x2)

00:23:19.710 --> 00:23:23.960
Kikezu ni naranda kage

00:23:39.750 --> 00:23:41.290
They're nice and hot!

00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:54.880
You little…

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.290
Nice and hot!
